---
subject: Automatic top-up turned off
preheader: Your automatic credit top-up of <%= it.amount %> could not be completed.
---
<div style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2563eb;">Credit</div><h1 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#18181b;">Automatic top-up turned off</h1><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525b;"><% if (it.reason === 'authentication_required') { %>Your bank asked for an extra authentication, which cannot be done without you, so the automatic top-up of <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.amount %></strong> was not charged.<% } else if (it.reason === 'payment_method_removed') { %>The card used for your automatic top-up of <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.amount %></strong> was removed, so nothing can be charged.<% } else { %>Your card was declined for the automatic top-up of <strong style="color:#18181b;"><%= it.amount %></strong>, so nothing was charged.<% } %></p><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525b;">The option is now off. When your credit runs out, AI features stop working until you add credit or turn the option back on with a valid card.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:26px 0 0;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#2563eb" style="border-radius:10px;background-color:#2563eb;"><a class="email-btn" href="<%= it.url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 30px;font-family:'Inter','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;">Review my credit</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="margin:6px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;background-color:#f4f4f7;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-all;"><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;"><%= it.url %></a></p>
===TEXT===
Automatic top-up turned off

<% if (it.reason === 'authentication_required') { %>Your bank asked for an extra authentication, which cannot be done without you, so the automatic top-up of <%= it.amount %> was not charged.<% } else if (it.reason === 'payment_method_removed') { %>The card used for your automatic top-up of <%= it.amount %> was removed, so nothing can be charged.<% } else { %>Your card was declined for the automatic top-up of <%= it.amount %>, so nothing was charged.<% } %>

The option is now off. When your credit runs out, AI features stop working until you add credit or turn the option back on with a valid card.

Review your credit:
  <%= it.url %>
